{"alias":"/learning/specialed/supervision/process","title":"Supervision, Monitoring, and Support - Monitoring Process","changed":"2026-06-17T19:35:28+00:00","before":"<h3><img alt=\"Monitoring Process Web Banner\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"a1e76118-f2ce-4c31-8cc1-68b354f0955c\" height=\"100%\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/Special%20Services%20-%20Supervision%20-%20Monitoring%20Process%20Web%20Banner.png\" width=\"100%\" /></h3>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Monitoring Process</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<ol>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><strong>Self Assessment</strong>:&nbsp;Districts complete the 2026-2027&nbsp;Self Assessment form.&nbsp; Each SAU is sent a link specific to them in June.&nbsp; <a href=\"https://forms.office.com/g/wrKEL0Bwxs\">Access a model/practice form here.</a></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><strong>Site Visit</strong>: The team will come onsite to verify information reviewed as part of the Self Assessment as well as forms, policies, and federal indicator data.&nbsp; The <a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"0be1115b-37e1-4867-a2d9-5fb91b4df2eb\" filename=\"Supervision and Monitoring - Visit Dates - 6.16.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Supervision%20and%20Monitoring%20-%20Visit%20Dates%20-%206.16.2026.pdf\" title=\"Supervision and Monitoring - Visit Dates - 6.16.2026.pdf\">date of the onsite visit</a>&nbsp;is included in the Letter of Notification, June email.</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li><strong>Next Steps</strong>:\r\n\t<ol>\r\n\t\t<li>&nbsp;Pre-findings, if applicable, correction within 30 days (optional).</li>\r\n\t\t<li>Child-specific findings related to Abbreviated Day documentation <strong>must</strong> be corrected within 30 days.</li>\r\n\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"c13b0fbf-0df7-4800-a5cf-92c3be62ffa5\" filename=\"Special Services - Sample SOF - 8-28-2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Special%20Services%20-%20Sample%20SOF%20-%208-28-2024.pdf\" title=\"Special Services - Sample SOF - 8-28-2024\">Summary of Findings</a>&nbsp; and&nbsp;<a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"d78f95c7-f0ae-490b-8ba4-69d11579b2cf\" filename=\"Special Services - Sample CAP - 8-28-2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Special%20Services%20-%20Sample%20CAP%20-%208-28-2024.pdf\" title=\"Special Services - Sample CAP - 8-28-2024\">Corrective Action Plan</a>&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<ol>\r\n\t\t\t<li>Issued on January 31 for site visits November-December.</li>\r\n\t\t\t<li>Issued on June 30 for site visits April-May.</li>\r\n\t\t</ol>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"1a31d135-0d94-40f8-a335-b1886a363e75\" filename=\"Special Services - Sample CAP Specific Training - 8-28-2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Special%20Services%20-%20Sample%20CAP%20Specific%20Training%20-%208-28-2024.pdf\" title=\"Special Services - Sample CAP Specific Training - 8-28-2024\">CAP Specific training</a> and <a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-substitution=\"file\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"5de52ef5-9a58-419d-ba22-fdc89bfa1891\" filename=\"Supervision and Monitoring - SAU Rubric - 6.16.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Supervision%20and%20Monitoring%20-%20SAU%20Rubric%20-%206.16.2026.pdf\" title=\"Supervision and Monitoring - SAU Rubric - 6.16.2026.pdf\">support as needed</a>&nbsp;throughout the year.</li>\r\n\t</ol>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><em><em>Federal Regulations dictate correction of <u>each</u> instance of noncompliance as soon as possible but in no case longer than one year. (OSEP Q&amp;A 23-01)</em></em></p>\r\n\r\n<p><em style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">Please note that the process varies for Communities Without Schools (CWS) and Regional Programs.&nbsp; Please see Monitoring Timeline and Resources for more information.</em></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-align-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\r\n<div class=\"card\"><img alt=\"presenter showing notes\" class=\"card-img-top\" height=\"100%\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/2023-11/calendar.jpg\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h5 class=\"card-title\">Monitoring Timeline</h5>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"2c426a58-a122-41e3-bc30-cc8b12c56677\" filename=\"Supervision and Monitoring - SAU Timeline - 6.16.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Supervision%20and%20Monitoring%20-%20SAU%20Timeline%20-%206.16.2026.pdf\" title=\"Supervision and Monitoring - SAU Timeline - 6.16.2026.pdf\">2026&nbsp;- 2027&nbsp;SAU Monitoring Timeline</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Supervision%20and%20Monitoring%20-%202025-26%20CWS%20Monitoring%20Timeline%20-%206.5.2025.pdf\">2025&nbsp;- 2026&nbsp;CWS Monitoring Timeline</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"16e3e559-1942-41f1-8f05-3d6a0d78d366\" filename=\"Supervision and Monitoring - CDS Timeline - 6.16.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Supervision%20and%20Monitoring%20-%20CDS%20Timeline%20-%206.16.2026.pdf\" title=\"Supervision and Monitoring - CDS Timeline - 6.16.2026.pdf\">2026&nbsp;- 2027&nbsp;CDS Monitoring Timeline</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"ef41e9ed-aba4-4b86-a3e5-4ea6111a525e\" filename=\"Supervision and Monitoring - Regional Program Timeline - 6.16.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Supervision%20and%20Monitoring%20-%20Regional%20Program%20Timeline%20-%206.16.2026.pdf\" title=\"Supervision and Monitoring - Regional Program Timeline - 6.16.2026.pdf\">2026&nbsp;- 2027&nbsp;Regional Program Monitoring Timeline</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\r\n<div class=\"card\"><img alt=\"Cohort Banner\" class=\"card-img-top\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/Special%20Services%20-%20Monitoring%20Process%20Cohort%20Banner.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h5 class=\"card-title\">Cohort Training</h5>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><strong>2026-2027&nbsp;Cohort Process Training</strong><br />\r\n\t<a href=\"https://youtu.be/-NeqCHJH6eE?si=rE4A441_nAaQKumj\">Video</a>&nbsp;| <a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"c183e2b1-d082-42dc-8cc8-11ad2b2f0e88\" filename=\"Supervision and Monitoring - Cohort Training - 6.16.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Supervision%20and%20Monitoring%20-%20Cohort%20Training%20-%206.16.2026.pdf\" title=\"Supervision and Monitoring - Cohort Training - 6.16.2026.pdf\">Presentation</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><strong>2025-2026&nbsp;Cohort Regional Program Training</strong><br />\r\n\t<a href=\"https://youtu.be/IUWY6krGeJo?si=9AlzhuY639nCBYaB\">Video</a>&nbsp;| <a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"e5b2a457-a87a-4263-84b5-c2f063206aea\" filename=\"Supervision and Monitoring - 2025-2026 Regional Program Cohort Training slides - 6.16.2025.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Supervision%20and%20Monitoring%20-%202025-2026%20Regional%20Program%20Cohort%20Training%20slides%20-%206.16.2025.pdf\" title=\"Supervision and Monitoring - 2025-2026 Regional Program Cohort Training slides - 6.16.2025.pdf\">Presentation</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><strong>2026-2027&nbsp;Preparing for File Review</strong><br />\r\n\t<a href=\"https://youtu.be/WAd9DRglJJU?si=YSPjydF60NNhYjeE\">Video</a>&nbsp;| <a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"1c5ac6de-c5de-41fb-869d-2bb4f12493de\" filename=\"Supervision and Monitoring - Preparing for the File Review - 6.16.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Supervision%20and%20Monitoring%20-%20Preparing%20for%20the%20File%20Review%20-%206.16.2026.pdf\" title=\"Supervision and Monitoring - Preparing for the File Review - 6.16.2026.pdf\">Presentation</a>\r\n\t<p><br />\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n","after":"<div class=\"doe-hero\">\n<p class=\"doe-eyebrow\">Supervision, Monitoring, and Support - SAUs</p>\n<p class=\"doe-lead\"><em><em>Federal Regulations dictate correction of each instance of noncompliance as soon as possible but in no case longer than one year. (OSEP Q&amp;A 23-01)</em></em></p>\n\n</div>\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"blockhead\" id=\"monitoring-process\"><h2>Monitoring Process</h2></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<ol>\r\n\t<li><strong>Self Assessment</strong>:&nbsp;Districts complete the 2026-2027&nbsp;Self Assessment form.&nbsp; Each SAU is sent a link specific to them in June.&nbsp; <a href=\"https://forms.office.com/g/wrKEL0Bwxs\" target=\"_blank\">Access a model/practice form here.</a></li>\r\n\t<li><strong>Site Visit</strong>: The team will come onsite to verify information reviewed as part of the Self Assessment as well as forms, policies, and federal indicator data.&nbsp; The <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Supervision%20and%20Monitoring%20-%20Visit%20Dates%20-%206.16.2026.pdf\" title=\"Supervision and Monitoring - Visit Dates - 6.16.2026.pdf\">date of the onsite visit</a>&nbsp;is included in the Letter of Notification, June email.</li>\r\n\t<li><strong>Next Steps</strong>:\r\n\t<ol>\r\n\t\t<li>&nbsp;Pre-findings, if applicable, correction within 30 days (optional).</li>\r\n\t\t<li>Child-specific findings related to Abbreviated Day documentation <strong>must</strong> be corrected within 30 days.</li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Special%20Services%20-%20Sample%20SOF%20-%208-28-2024.pdf\" title=\"Special Services - Sample SOF - 8-28-2024\">Summary of Findings</a>&nbsp; And&nbsp;<a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Special%20Services%20-%20Sample%20CAP%20-%208-28-2024.pdf\" title=\"Special Services - Sample CAP - 8-28-2024\">Corrective Action Plan</a>&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<ol>\r\n\t\t\t<li>Issued on January 31 for site visits November-December.</li>\r\n\t\t\t<li>Issued on June 30 for site visits April-May.</li>\r\n\t\t</ol>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Special%20Services%20-%20Sample%20CAP%20Specific%20Training%20-%208-28-2024.pdf\" title=\"Special Services - Sample CAP Specific Training - 8-28-2024\">CAP Specific training</a> And <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Supervision%20and%20Monitoring%20-%20SAU%20Rubric%20-%206.16.2026.pdf\" title=\"Supervision and Monitoring - SAU Rubric - 6.16.2026.pdf\">support as needed</a>&nbsp;throughout the year.</li>\r\n\t</ol>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p><em>Please note that the process varies for Communities Without Schools (CWS) and Regional Programs.&nbsp; Please see Monitoring Timeline and Resources for more information.</em></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\r\n<div class=\"card\"><img alt=\"presenter showing notes\" class=\"card-img-top\" height=\"100%\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/2023-11/calendar.jpg\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h3 class=\"card-title\">Monitoring Timeline</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Supervision%20and%20Monitoring%20-%20SAU%20Timeline%20-%206.16.2026.pdf\" title=\"Supervision and Monitoring - SAU Timeline - 6.16.2026.pdf\">2026&nbsp;- 2027&nbsp;SAU Monitoring Timeline</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Supervision%20and%20Monitoring%20-%202025-26%20CWS%20Monitoring%20Timeline%20-%206.5.2025.pdf\">2025&nbsp;- 2026&nbsp;CWS Monitoring Timeline</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Supervision%20and%20Monitoring%20-%20CDS%20Timeline%20-%206.16.2026.pdf\" title=\"Supervision and Monitoring - CDS Timeline - 6.16.2026.pdf\">2026&nbsp;- 2027&nbsp;CDS Monitoring Timeline</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Supervision%20and%20Monitoring%20-%20Regional%20Program%20Timeline%20-%206.16.2026.pdf\" title=\"Supervision and Monitoring - Regional Program Timeline - 6.16.2026.pdf\">2026&nbsp;- 2027&nbsp;Regional Program Monitoring Timeline</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\r\n<div class=\"card\"><img alt=\"Cohort Banner\" class=\"card-img-top\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/Special%20Services%20-%20Monitoring%20Process%20Cohort%20Banner.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h3 class=\"card-title\">Cohort Training</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><strong>2026-2027&nbsp;Cohort Process Training</strong><br />\r\n\t<a href=\"https://youtu.be/-NeqCHJH6eE?si=rE4A441_nAaQKumj\" target=\"_blank\">Video</a>&nbsp;| <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Supervision%20and%20Monitoring%20-%20Cohort%20Training%20-%206.16.2026.pdf\" title=\"Supervision and Monitoring - Cohort Training - 6.16.2026.pdf\">Presentation</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><strong>2025-2026&nbsp;Cohort Regional Program Training</strong><br />\r\n\t<a href=\"https://youtu.be/IUWY6krGeJo?si=9AlzhuY639nCBYaB\" target=\"_blank\">Video</a>&nbsp;| <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Supervision%20and%20Monitoring%20-%202025-2026%20Regional%20Program%20Cohort%20Training%20slides%20-%206.16.2025.pdf\" title=\"Supervision and Monitoring - 2025-2026 Regional Program Cohort Training slides - 6.16.2025.pdf\">Presentation</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><strong>2026-2027&nbsp;Preparing for File Review</strong><br />\r\n\t<a href=\"https://youtu.be/WAd9DRglJJU?si=YSPjydF60NNhYjeE\" target=\"_blank\">Video</a>&nbsp;| <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Supervision%20and%20Monitoring%20-%20Preparing%20for%20the%20File%20Review%20-%206.16.2026.pdf\" title=\"Supervision and Monitoring - Preparing for the File Review - 6.16.2026.pdf\">Presentation</a>\r\n\t\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\n<p class=\"doe-top\"><a href=\"#top\">Back to top</a></p>","notes":["1 section header — too few for a contents list."],"decisions":[{"id":"outline","on":true,"label":"Rebuild the heading outline","why":"2 headings sit at a level the page never opens — \"\" is an h3 with no h2 above it, so it is neither announced nor styled as the sub-section it is. Each heading moves to one level below whatever encloses it.","value":"h3 → h2"},{"id":"blockhead","on":true,"label":"Turn the headings into section headers","why":"2 headings are plain text where every other page uses a section header, so the page reads as one continuous wall instead of parts.","value":"2 sections"},{"id":"cardtitles","on":true,"label":"Put the card titles on one level","why":"2 card titles are written at a level copied from an example rather than chosen — h5 on a page whose sections are h2. Only the number changes.","value":"2 titles"},{"id":"items","on":true,"label":"Separate a link from its description","why":"2 list items open with a link and then explain it, all at the same weight — so the thing you can click is no easier to find than the sentence about it. The link becomes the item and the explanation sits under it.","value":"2 items"},{"id":"deck","on":true,"label":"Use this paragraph as the page description","why":"It is the page’s own opening paragraph, moved into the banner rather than rewritten.","value":"Federal Regulations dictate correction of each instance of noncompliance as soon as possible but in no case longer than one year. (OSEP Q&amp;A 23-01)"},{"id":"banner-graphic","on":true,"label":"Retire the old banner graphic","why":"It repeats the page title in picture form, which the new banner already does in type.","removes":"Special Services - Supervision - Monitoring Process Web Banner.png"},{"id":"descap","on":true,"label":"Start a description with a capital","why":"2 descriptions begin with a small letter, because they used to run on from the link after a dash. The dash is gone and the link now sits above in its own face, so each description opens a line of its own. One character changes and only ever the first.","value":"2 descriptions"},{"id":"eyebrow","on":true,"label":"Eyebrow: \"Supervision, Monitoring, and Support - SAUs\"","why":"Taken from the parent page, /learning/specialed/supervision."}],"mechanical":["empty paragraphs removed: 2","u tags unwrapped: 2","drupal entity attrs stripped: 47","target set by destination: 4","inline layout styles stripped: 1","paragraph inside a list item unwrapped: 2","redundant bold inside a heading removed: 1","empty divs removed: